munities can enhance Vonovia's reputation and support its business objectives.\n\n7. **Suppliers and Partners**: Vonovia's supply chain and partners also influence its ESG strategy. By working with suppliers and partners who share similar values and commitments to sustainability, Vonovia can strengthen its own ESG profile.\n\nEach of these groups has a unique perspective and set of expectations regarding Vonovia's ESG performance, and the company must consider these perspectives when developing and implementing its ESG strategy.",
