y adopt these recommendations to enhance its climate-related financial disclosures.\n\n7. **Paris Agreement**: As part of its commitment to addressing climate change, the Zumtobel Group likely aligns its operations and strategies with the goals of the Paris Agreement, aiming to limit global warming to well below 2 degrees Celsius above pre-industrial levels.\n\n8. **European Union’s Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD)**: For its operations within the EU, the Zumtobel Group will need to comply with the CSRD, which requires companies to report on a range of sustainability topics in a standardized format.\n\nBy adhering to these frameworks and principles, the Zumtobel Group demonstrates its commitment to sustainable development and responsible business practices.",
