aw**: Ensuring that business practices do not violate competition law, which aims to promote fair competition and prevent monopolistic practices.\n\n9. **Accessibility Standards**: Ensuring that websites and digital services are accessible to people with disabilities, adhering to standards such as the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG).\n\nScout24 would need to comply with all relevant laws and regulations in each jurisdiction where it operates to maintain its legal standing and protect its users. Regular updates and audits are necessary to stay compliant with evolving legal requirements.",
