reate a culture where everyone feels valued and included, regardless of their abilities or backgrounds.\n\nIn summary, the collaboration between UNIQA Stiftung and Special Olympics Austria not only supports a specific cause but also serves as a catalyst for broader societal change, reinforcing the importance of inclusion as a fundamental aspect of ESG principles.",
