y embed ESG themes into its content, making it easier for employees to absorb and apply these principles in their daily work.\n\nBy integrating these components into the Security Awareness Programme, organizations can create a comprehensive approach to security education that not only enhances operational resilience but also supports broader corporate social responsibility initiatives. This holistic strategy helps in building trust among stakeholders, including customers, investors, and regulatory bodies, all of whom increasingly value companies that demonstrate strong ESG performance.",
