    "category": "ESG",
    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nWhy was the previous upper limit for severance payments in the event of a change of control structured as three times the annual remuneration, and how does its cancellation reflect evolving governance priorities? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nThe previous upper limit for severance payments in the event of a change of control was set at three times the total annual remuneration of the Chairman of the Management Board. This provision was later cancelled with effect from 1 January 2024.<|im_end|>"
