activities comply with minimum social safeguards as defined by the regulation.\n\nIt's important to note that the exact metrics and methodologies for disclosure are detailed in the Delegated Acts accompanying the EU Taxonomy Regulation, and companies should refer to these documents for precise guidance tailored to their specific sectors and activities. Compliance with the EU Taxonomy Regulation is an ongoing process that requires continuous monitoring and reporting.",
