aterial use, improving energy efficiency, or decreasing emissions, can also align with the circular economy objective. If Manz AG’s innovations significantly enhance the sustainability of its products or services, it could meet this criterion.\n\nTo achieve alignment with the circular economy objective, Manz AG would need to demonstrate that its activities contribute substantially to at least one of these criteria and do no significant harm to any of the other environmental objectives outlined in the EU Taxonomy Regulation. This involves detailed analysis and reporting on how its activities impact the environment throughout their lifecycle, from production to end-of-life disposal or recycling.",
