ects qualify under the taxonomy and thus should be included in the calculation of the CapEx KPI.\n\nIn summary, while the exact asset categories will depend on the specifics of a company's operations and investments, the key is to ensure that the denominator of the CapEx KPI reflects expenditures that contribute to one or more of the six environmental objectives specified by the EU Taxonomy.",
