rds, including those related to deforestation, land use, and pollution.\n\n7. **Transparency and Reporting**: Providing transparent reporting on environmental performance and sustainability metrics, which helps stakeholders understand how the company is contributing to environmental goals.\n\nMeeting these criteria helps ensure that battery manufacturing activities align with the EU's broader goals of reducing carbon emissions and promoting sustainable economic growth. Compliance with the EU Taxonomy can also open up access to certain financial incentives and support mechanisms designed to encourage sustainable business practices.",
