he EU Taxonomy is designed to guide investment decisions and corporate disclosures towards sustainable activities, rather than providing a detailed breakdown of accounting categories like operating expenses. Companies should refer to the detailed criteria provided in the EU Taxonomy Regulation and its delegated acts for guidance on how their specific activities and expenses might align with the taxonomy's requirements.",
