hat the methodologies used for assessing climate-related activities remain relevant and effective.\n\nThe stability of Freenet AG’s compliance approach, as reflected in this decision, underscores the company’s commitment to maintaining a consistent and reliable stance on environmental sustainability. This approach not only helps in building trust among stakeholders but also ensures that the company remains aligned with the evolving landscape of environmental regulations and expectations.",
