ection might highlight improvements in transparency and reporting practices that result from using these metrics. Enhanced transparency is vital for building trust among stakeholders, including investors, customers, and regulators.\n\nThese metrics are significant under the EU Taxonomy framework because they provide a standardized way to measure and communicate the environmental impact of economic activities. By aligning with these metrics, companies like Viscom can ensure they are making contributions towards the EU’s goal of achieving a net-zero greenhouse gas emission economy by 2050, while also complying with evolving regulatory requirements and investor expectations for sustainability.",
