    "category": "EU Taxonomy",
    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nWhy do the verification methodologies under ISO 14044 and ISO 14040 prevent selected e-trucks from achieving taxonomy-alignment, and how does this reflect the EU Taxonomy's emphasis on rigorous environmental standards? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nThey were assessed as taxonomy-eligible because they met certain criteria but not taxonomy-aligned due to their life-cycle GHG emissions reduction calculations being verified under ISO 14044 and ISO 14040, which do not fulfill the substantial contribution criteria required by ISO 14067.<|im_end|>"
