s regulations evolve, companies need to stay aligned with the latest interpretations and requirements. A thorough understanding and application of the EU Taxonomy ensure that the company remains compliant with evolving regulatory frameworks.\n\nIn summary, the company's interpretation of the EU Taxonomy Regulation in the \"Consolidated disclosures for the taxonomy regulation\" section is crucial for maintaining legal compliance, enhancing transparency, managing risks, building stakeholder trust, facilitating benchmarking, and staying aligned with regulatory changes. This ensures that the Non-Financial Report accurately reflects the company's commitment to sustainability and its alignment with environmental goals.",
