ts will contribute positively to climate change mitigation efforts. This supports the overall goal of channeling financial resources towards environmentally beneficial activities.\n\nIn summary, the technical assessment criteria for suppliers in the '3.6 Manufacture of other low-carbon technologies' activity class play a crucial role in ensuring that the products and services produced genuinely contribute to the EU Taxonomy's climate change mitigation objectives, fostering a sustainable economy.",
