    "question_type": "factoid",
    "category": "Sustainability",
    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nWhat applications of PFAS are highlighted as essential for sustainable industries in the context? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nPFAS-coated pipes, additives for the insulation of buildings, coatings, intermediates, medical products, pharmaceutical active ingredients, polyfluoroalkyl substances, polymers classified as a subgroup of PFAS, precursors<|im_end|>"
