    "question_type": "factoid",
    "category": "Sustainability",
    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nWhat obstacles are impacting the scalability of renewable energy projects involving PV systems? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nearly planning, hardware, high demand, installation teams, limited capacities of grid access, sufficient lead time<|im_end|>"
