**: The inclusion of these acquisitions can have both positive and negative impacts on Vonovia’s environmental and governance goals. On one hand, it may increase the company’s carbon footprint or other environmental metrics due to the scale of the acquisitions. On the other hand, it provides an opportunity to implement more sustainable practices across a larger portfolio, potentially leading to greater overall environmental benefits.\n\nIn summary, the inclusion of acquisitions like Bien-Ries and H&L Immobilien GmbH in Vonovia SE's sustainability report reflects the company's dedication to transparency, integration of best practices, and alignment with broader sustainability and governance objectives. This approach helps ensure that all parts of the company are moving towards common goals, thereby enhancing the company's reputation and operational sustainability.",
