s overall carbon footprint. This, in turn, enables the setting of realistic and meaningful reduction targets.\n\n8. **Regulatory Compliance**: Many regions and countries are implementing regulations that require companies to disclose their Scope 3 emissions, which include procurement-related emissions. Combining these categories ensures compliance with such regulations.\n\nBy integrating 'purchased goods and services' and 'capital goods' into a single 'procurement' category, organizations can achieve a more accurate and comprehensive assessment of their environmental impact, leading to more effective sustainability strategies and reporting.",
