roviding detailed data for Lenzing Aktiengesellschaft ensures compliance with these requirements and demonstrates the company’s commitment to adhering to legal and ethical standards.\n\nOverall, this approach to sustainability reporting by Lenzing AG not only meets but often exceeds expectations for transparency and accountability, thereby building trust among various stakeholder groups.",
