office sector has seen significant sector-specific initiatives aimed at promoting sustainability. For example,GRESB (Global Real Estate Sustainability Benchmark) has specific modules tailored for office assets, which can drive participation and certification rates.\n\nThis situation reveals that sector-specific sustainability strategies are crucial for effective implementation of green practices. Different sectors face varying levels of regulatory pressure, market demand, operational challenges, and investor expectations. Therefore, a one-size-fits-all approach to sustainability may not be as effective as tailored strategies that address the unique needs and opportunities within each sector. It also suggests that there is room for improvement in other sectors where sustainability certification coverage is lower, indicating potential areas for growth and innovation in sustainability practices.",
