    "category": "Sustainability",
    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nHow does the company ensure that its products and solutions achieve a sustainability profile significantly above market reference levels, and why is this important for its Next Generation Solutions strategy? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nProducts and solutions with a superior sustainability profile are those whose sustainability characteristics are above or significantly above the market reference level, as defined by the company's Next Generation Solutions process.<|im_end|>"
