ncy and transparency not only enhances the credibility of the reports but also demonstrates the Zumtobel Group's dedication to sustainable practices and responsible corporate governance. It shows that the company values accountability and aims to provide clear, reliable information about its environmental impact and progress towards sustainability goals.",
