    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nWhat do K2 Systems' workforce and leadership indicators reveal when gender representation, employment stability, and employee retention are evaluated together? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nThe workforce comprised 127 women and 191 men, so women represented about 40%, while women held 36% of leadership positions, above the cited German average of 29%. Permanent contracts accounted for 94.03%, and turnover was 15.6%, about half the cited national rate of 30%. The data suggests relatively stable employment and stronger-than-benchmark female leadership, though neither measure establishes parity.<|im_end|>"
