    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nHow should SPIES Kunststoffe's 13 reportable accidents be interpreted in relation to workforce size, fatalities, and its preventive health-and-safety system? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nWith 386 employees, 13 reportable accidents correspond to the disclosed rate of 3.37%, while no work-related deaths occurred. SPIES supports prevention through an occupational safety officer and committee, annual training for all employees, company medical care, ergonomic support, and noise-reduction measures. The zero-fatality outcome therefore coexists with a non-zero accident frequency requiring continued prevention.<|im_end|>"
