    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nHow can Hotel Chamade's higher total and per-stay energy consumption in 2025 coexist with zero reported Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions, and which operational changes support this result? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nEnergy use rose from 163.34 MWh and 13.66 kWh per stay in 2024 to 244.33 MWh and 15.54 kWh per stay in 2025, partly because 2024 renovations temporarily closed floors and 2025 had more stays. Emissions nevertheless fell to zero for Scopes 1 and 2 because the hotel used 100% renewable electricity and eliminated the prior 0.16 tonnes of direct emissions, supported by efficient HVAC, LEDs, insulation, and an electric delivery van.<|im_end|>"
