    "category": "VS/VSME",
    "text": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nHow should Coroplast's governance-body gender diversity ratio of 0.5 be translated into actual representation, and what imbalance does it reveal? <|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nThe relevant administrative, management, and supervisory body comprised one woman and two men. Dividing the number of women by the number of men gives the reported ratio of 0.5. Women therefore held one of three positions, while men held two, showing female representation but not gender parity.<|im_end|>"
